{
    "title": "The Spike - Volleyball Story",
    "description": "\"The thrill of spiking in volleyball. Why don't you try it out?\"\r\n\r\nDeveloped by a indie developer who loves volleyball! \r\nThe sports game made after numerous trial and error to contain the appeal of volleyball!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Try out various volleyball strategies!\r\nQuicks, pipes, open attacks, and fast tempo attacks in a 3v3 volleyball match!\r\nAchieve your greatest spike in diverse scenarios in your screen!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Immersive gameplay!\r\nExperience the immersion of actually playing on the court yourself\r\nby controlling only 1 player on the court from start to finish.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Appealing storyline!\r\nMeet the attractive characters that appear in the universe of The Spike!\r\nJoin Siwoo with his journey in both volleyball and inner growth.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Diverse volleyball contents!\r\nIs normal volleyball boring for you? Enjoy different types of volleyball \r\ncontents such as tournament, colosseum, beach volleyball, and more.",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;The thrill of spiking in volleyball. Why don&#39;t you try it out?&quot;<br><br>Developed by a indie developer who loves volleyball! <br>The sports game made after numerous trial and error to contain the appeal of volleyball!<br><br>\u25a0 Try out various volleyball strategies!<br>Quicks, pipes, open attacks, and fast tempo attacks in a 3v3 volleyball match!<br>Achieve your greatest spike in diverse scenarios in your screen!<br><br>\u25a0 Immersive gameplay!<br>Experience the immersion of actually playing on the court yourself<br>by controlling only 1 player on the court from start to finish.<br><br>\u25a0 Appealing storyline!<br>Meet the attractive characters that appear in the universe of The Spike!<br>Join Siwoo with his journey in both volleyball and inner growth.<br><br>\u25a0 Diverse volleyball contents!<br>Is normal volleyball boring for you? Enjoy different types of volleyball <br>contents such as tournament, colosseum, beach volleyball, and more.",
